Bend v2.0.16: stack-safe checker comparison traversal

Upstream-Commit: 981899d6b2fb2c109ed83545cffed9d20910a025
Upstream-Source: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bendlang/bend/981899d6b2fb2c109ed83545cffed9d20910a025/bend2/bend.ts
