Patched-bend.ts-SHA256: b29828dc987f15247dc41f76fe1f3e2c7971d6642ea6655c3ab483893da90213

Replace recursive term_compare calls with explicit continuations and tail
iteration. Preserve left-to-right forcing, structural short-circuiting,
eager kind-meet branches, delayed codomain opening and binder depths.
No memoization, checker bypass, source-language change or runtime change.

